   * invoice — but listed in its own module, and its end customers are off limits to us directly
   * (see `Company.managedByResellerId`).
   */
  RESELLER
  VENDOR
  OEM
  DISTRIBUTOR
  PARTNER
  /**
   * An agent/broker/referral party Wroffy pays a commission to — shares the vendor onboarding lifecycle (`vendorStatus`/`vendorCode`) but is listed separately in the Commission Parties module.
   */
  COMMISSION_PARTY
